* FastHenry output for magic cell top

.Units um
.Default rho=0.02 nhinc=3 nwinc=3 rh=2 rw=2

* Reference plane (substrate, ground)
Gsub x1=-6.00 y1=0.00 z1=0 x2=40.00 y2=0.00 z2=0
+ x3=40.00 y3=30.00 z3=0
+ thick=0.1 seg1=4 seg2=4
+ Ngp (-6.00,0.00,0)

Nsub x=-6.00 y=0.00 z=0
.Equiv Nsub Ngp

.freq fmin= 0 fmax= 0

* Order of arguments to SPICE subcircuit call:
* 1 IN

.end
